iosim
=====

This project is an independent reimplementation of the iOS Simulator's
runtime substrate for native x86_64 hosts.

Format references
-----------------
The Mach-O chained-fixup structures and relocation semantics implemented in
loader/macho.h and loader/fixups.c follow the publicly documented formats in
Apple's open-source dyld project (APSL 2.0), in particular
include/mach-o/fixup-chains.h and common/MachOLoaded.cpp. A copy of Apple's
license is in LICENSES/APPLE-APSL-2.0.txt.

Prior art
---------
Darling (https://github.com/darlinghq/darling, GPL-3.0) and ipasim
(https://github.com/ipasimulator/ipasim) were studied for the architecture of
Mach-O loading, Darwin syscall translation and Objective-C runtime porting.
No source code from those projects is included here; iosim's loader, runtime
and tools are original implementations.

Apple binaries
--------------
No Apple runtime binaries, SDK libraries or other proprietary Apple content
are distributed in this repository. The GitHub Actions workflows under
recon-runner/ operate on GitHub-hosted macOS runners and upload only
generated metadata and self-built test binaries.
